  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* docs: sync the docs version from Cargo.toml by @anistark in https://github.com/anistark/feluda/pull/262\r\n* docs: document the container and filesystem sources, and feluda init by @anistark in https://github.com/anistark/feluda/pull/266\r\n* feat(filesystem): read the rpm ndb database backend by @anistark in https://github.com/anistark/feluda/pull/267\r\n* build(deps): bump org.springframework:spring-core from 6.2.11 to 6.2.19 in /examples/java-example/maven-example in the maven group across 1 directory by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/anistark/feluda/pull/268\r\n* feat(filesystem): catalog Go modules from compiled binary build info by @anistark in https://github.com/anistark/feluda/pull/269\r\n* feat(image): scan a docker save tarball or OCI layout as a source by @anistark in https://github.com/anistark/feluda/pull/270\r\n* fix(image): skip index entries the archive does not carry by @anistark in https://github.com/anistark/feluda/pull/271\r\n* feat(clearlydefined): answer from a definitions file for air gapped builds by @anistark in https://github.com/anistark/feluda/pull/274\r\n* chore(deps): update dependencies, move to quick-xml 0.42 and dirs 7 by @anistark in https://github.com/anistark/feluda/pull/279\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/anistark/feluda/compare/v1.16.0...v1.17.0",
